  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic paths and no concurrent ordinary citizen/traffic work; not native mod-work or clock-lateness proof.",
    "One logical food quote request per unit, 128 total units and 2 ms soft time budget remain unchanged; selected geometry and return revalidation are separate, and a single native query can overrun that budget.",
    "Old counter reproduced by charging every non-traffic unit; both modes run the same decision code and publish a snapshot per frame. Warmup once then three alternating measured runs.",
    "Saved-state hashes, including decisions, reasons and money, match across all runs/accounting modes per scenario. No raw saves committed.",
    "6 Nov rig remains required before merge; native p95 below 5 ms and every spike at least 30 ms flagged.",
    "Policy-only p95 at 1024 native-length IDs is 0.2402 ms in the R2 gate, above the 0.20 ms engineering target (R1 0.1989 ms); no policy algorithm changes in this fix."
  ]
